    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The &#8220;Delete All Comments of WordPress&#8221; plugin allows administrators to remove all comments from their WordPress website in one click — including approved, pending, spam, and trashed comments.</p>\n<p>Use this plugin under:</p>\n<p><strong>Tools &gt; Delete Comments</strong></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Go to Plugins &gt; Add New &gt; Upload &gt; Select &#8216;delete-all-comments-of-wordpress-website.zip&#8217; &gt; Install Now</li>\n<li>Or unzip and upload &#8216;delete-all-comments-of-wordpress-website&#8217; to the &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/&#8217; directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin via the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu.</li>\n<li>Go to <strong>Tools &gt; Delete Comments</strong> to use the plugin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20about%20support%3F'>\nWhat about support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Create a support ticket on the WordPress.org support forum, and I’ll take care of it.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>5.8</h4>\n<p>Changed support link.</p>\n<h4>5.7</h4>\n<p>Added new supporter images and updated support link.</p>\n<h4>5.6</h4>\n<p>Bug fix: Prevents deletion of WooCommerce order notes.</p>\n<h4>5.5</h4>\n<p>Minor bug fix.</p>\n<h4>5.4</h4>\n<p>Added banner.</p>\n<h4>5.1</h4>\n<p>SDK update and UI improvements.</p>\n<h4>4.3</h4>\n<p>Added new options.</p>\n<h4>3.0</h4>\n<p>Stability improvements and bug fixes.</p>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Delete all comments from your WordPress database (Approved, Pending, Spam, Trash) with a single click.",
